1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,533
Then Sam lifts the lamp. The walls are
covered in scratches, floor to
ceiling.

2
00:00:05,033 --> 00:00:10,567
Rule fifteen. Keep count of the days.
The day you stop counting is the day
you stop.

3
00:00:11,067 --> 00:00:16,533
Seven thousand, six hundred and
seventy marks. Twenty-one years. The
last one was cut this morning.

4
00:00:17,033 --> 00:00:19,200
She's alive. So why is she hiding from
you?
